cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this ontology, please cite it as below."
title: "BEAO — Built Environment Accessibility Ontology"
abstract: "A core OWL 2 DL ontology for machine-interpretable accessibility compliance in the built environment. Jurisdiction-agnostic, extensible via national modules. The Brazil module (beao-br) formalizes ABNT NBR 9050:2020. Includes semantic alignment with WHO ICF 2026-01."
version: 0.1.1
date-released: 2026-09-21
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22866431
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: https://github.com/ciatec-org/beao
url: https://w3id.org/beao

keywords:
  - accessibility
  - built environment
  - ontology
  - OWL
  - semantic web
  - NBR 9050
  - ICF
  - ABNT
  - linked data
  - universal design

